title: variables
---
<<declare $PuSceneMeting = false>>
<<declare $PuSceneFishing = false>>
<<declare $met_grandfather = false>>
===

// ============================================================
// Entry gate — ตั้งใน NPCDialogue.yarnStartNode ของ "Pu" แทน
// "Scene1_MeetGrandfather" ตรงๆ เพื่อให้ interact ครั้งถัดไปไปต่อ Scene2
// ============================================================
title: Pu_Entry
---
<<if $met_grandfather>>
    <<jump Scene2_Quest1_OldRod>>
<<else>>
    <<jump Scene1_MeetGrandfather>>
<<endif>>
===

// ============================================================
// ฉากเริ่มเกม
// ============================================================
title: Start
---
<<LockControlls "player(V3)">>
Player: So this is it… #line:09933ad 
Player: Wait — did the boat drop me at the wrong dock? #line:025eda6 
Player: No. No, the sign says the right name. #line:002fb2b 
<<UnlockControlls "player(V3)">>
===

// ============================================================
// ฉาก 1 — เจอปู่
// ============================================================
title: Scene1_MeetGrandfather
---
<<camera_shoulder_in "Dialogue System" "Pu">>
GRANDPA: Afternoon boat's on time today. #line:0a66ae3 
GRANDPA: Doesn't happen often #line:0c281c4 
// หันมา เงียบไปครู่หนึ่ง
GRANDPA: …Oh. #line:06da195 
GRANDPA: Look how big you've gotten. #line:0db1da3 
Player: You still recognize me? #line:0829a6a 
GRANDPA: Of course I do. I'm old, not blind. #line:04f38ee 
GRANDPA: So — you came all this way on your own? #line:0d21fc2 
Player: School's out for the break. I thought I'd come visit. #line:0feaf76 
GRANDPA: Mm… that's good. Good to rest a while. #line:017d06b 
Player: Grandpa… why's the town so quiet? #line:0ef5b11 
GRANDPA: Ah. Well. #line:0792202 
GRANDPA: Used to be, you couldn't find a free spot along this whole pier. Every ship crossing the water had to stop here. Supplies, repairs, somewhere for the crew to sleep. Wasn't a choice — there was nowhere else. #line:0388022 
GRANDPA: Then the ships got better. Faster, bigger holds. They didn't need to stop anymore. #line:0f1a33b 
GRANDPA: So folks packed up, little by little. That's just how it went. The world moved along without us. #line:0299627 
GRANDPA: Well. Now that you're here. #line:0209e99 
GRANDPA: There's something I want to show you.  #line:06ace64 
<<camera_reset "Dialogue System">>
<<UnlockControlls "player(V3)">>
<<npc_walk_to_point "Talk Area" "Point">>
<<npc_walk_to_point "Talk Area" "Point 2">>
<<npc_turn_to_point "Talk Area" "LookAt">>
<<set $met_grandfather = true>>
===

// // ============================================================
// // ฉาก 2 — เควส 1: เบ็ดเก่า
// // ============================================================
title: Scene2_Quest1_OldRod
---
<<camera_shoulder_in "Dialogue System" "Pu">>
Player: What is this, a warehouse?
GRANDPA: This is the last thing I ever built. The one I never finished.
Player: It's an aquarium?
GRANDPA: It was going to be.
GRANDPA: When the ships stopped coming, folks needed a reason to stop here again. I thought — give them something to see. Something worth the crossing.
GRANDPA: That was the idea, anyway. Last one I had.
Player: So what happened?
GRANDPA: I got old. That's what happened.
GRANDPA: Glass is heavy. Pipes are heavier. Got to where I'd work an hour and need to sit for three.
GRANDPA: One day I sat down and just… didn't get back up.
GRANDPA: Been sitting ever since.
Player: …
Player: Then let me finish it.
GRANDPA: What?
Player: I want to help you finish it.
GRANDPA: …
GRANDPA: You came here to rest.
Player: I came here to see you.
GRANDPA: Hmmm.
GRANDPA: Then take this.
Player: Wait — this is my old rod.
GRANDPA: You remember it, huh.
Player: Of course I remember it. I thought it was gone.
GRANDPA: I kept it. In case somebody came back to use it.
<<AddItem>>
<<set $has_old_rod = true>>
<<camera_reset "Dialogue System">>
===

title: ResetAllProgress
---
<<set $has_old_rod = false>>
<<set $has_new_rod = false>>
<<set $junk_sold = false>>
<<set $fish_caught_count = 0>>
<<set $The_Seagull_CurrentLv = 1>>
===